  "direction": "Calm British analyst; exact ten published lines and original speeds. Keep the final short line clean without an added syllable.",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "l1",
      "text": "On the map, this is still a sea.",
      "start": 2.05,
      "duration": 2.6160000000000005,
      "voice": "bf_emma",
      "speed": 0.9,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "text": "In nineteen seventy-seven, it was.",
      "start": 7.85,
      "duration": 2.84,
      "voice": "bf_emma",
      "speed": 1,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "text": "Then its rivers went to the cotton fields.",
      "start": 10.78,
      "duration": 2.8100000000000005,
      "voice": "bf_emma",
      "speed": 1,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "l4",
      "text": "By twenty fourteen, the eastern basin had dried.",
      "start": 13.68,
      "duration": 3.1799999999999997,
      "voice": "bf_emma",
      "speed": 1,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "l5",
      "text": "This was a fishing port.",
      "start": 16.95,
      "duration": 2.080000000000002,
      "voice": "bf_emma",
      "speed": 1,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "l6",
      "text": "Today, the sea is ninety-five kilometres away.",
      "start": 19.12,
      "duration": 3.4659999999999975,
      "voice": "bf_emma",
      "speed": 1,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "l7",
      "text": "But up north, a dam went in.",
      "start": 23.72,
      "duration": 2.559000000000001,
      "voice": "bf_emma",
      "speed": 0.9,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "l8",
      "text": "And the water came back.",
      "start": 26.7,
      "duration": 2.2950000000000017,
      "voice": "bf_emma",
      "speed": 0.9,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "l9",
      "text": "The sea did not come back on its own.",
      "start": 29.4,
      "duration": 2.8100000000000023,
      "voice": "bf_emma",
      "speed": 0.9,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "l10",
      "text": "Someone kept it.",
      "start": 32.3,
      "duration": 1.8500000000000014,
      "voice": "bf_emma",
      "speed": 0.9,
      "language": "en-gb"
    }
  ]
